d there was nothing he could do about the current situation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is currently being encouraged by a friend to change jobs for a fresh start."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161958"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a86b3e17a2a509eeb164b029ddd80873600a35b6aa6667d6fab5c1b5b8b6da22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5c624936ed74e73c43d34775fff11906b0369ce00c5493ecd575256d4f38abe.webp","width":152,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161959","characterName":"曽我 到","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161959"},"originalCharacterName":"曽我 到","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Azusa's husband and government worker."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has ambitions to eventually make a move into politics but tends to hide his ambitions from his family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is an intelligent man whose always planning for the future of his family while keeping up a friendly persona."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161959"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c80d0cc0341d6201b35c376af1b5deb7d29faaae5ad256fa0d1682bf39cff23.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0efd64a05648872ad38b7fdff93c4f3c467a7f64777407ef1c6760955bb6ece5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161960","characterName":"曽我 たすく","sourceIds":{"vndbCha